{"1333620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Prison", "steam_appid": 1333620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Prison is a sandbox-style Simulation/Rpg game. Start your own gang inside the prison or become model prisoner- it's up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/c30d1d23753d14417afd703c3264cb57.poster.avif?t=1774504934\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/c30d1d23753d14417afd703c3264cb57.webm?t=1774504934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/c30d1d23753d14417afd703c3264cb57.mp4?t=1774504934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Key Features:</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/5e54af262c16313b3f80a7225a7ec565.poster.avif?t=1774504934\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/5e54af262c16313b3f80a7225a7ec565.webm?t=1774504934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/5e54af262c16313b3f80a7225a7ec565.mp4?t=1774504934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex Simulation:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Prison utilizes many complex systems to allow players to experience prison life. Do the legitimate job of preparing food in the kitchen to work in the workshop to earn money. It is not easy for a prisoner to acquire money, but it's essential to have some disposable cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Expanding Gameplay:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > While the current version of Project Prison already includes many different mechanisms, the gameplay will continually expand to include more advanced mechanics during the early access period.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/c5da92cf339715147ea5be2c97a2f134.poster.avif?t=1774504934\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/c5da92cf339715147ea5be2c97a2f134.webm?t=1774504934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/c5da92cf339715147ea5be2c97a2f134.mp4?t=1774504934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gang Wars:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There are several factions inside the prison. Each faction controls certain areas and illegal trade in the prison. Managing the relationship with them at the neutral level is a tough task, but joining any gang will result in making multiple enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start Your Illegal Trading Empire:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn some extra money by starting your illegal trade inside the prison. Your trade empire's future relies on your ability to adapt to the ever-changing conditions in jail. Being friends with correct people will take you too far in this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulator:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Prison gives you complete control of your character! You can do whatever you like, remember that your loose actions may also affect relations with other inmates. You can also commit your time to exercise or in the library to enhance knowledge in addition to multiple prison block with different areas to interact and improve your character's core skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Prison is a sandbox-style Simulation/Rpg game. Start your own gang inside the prison or become model prisoner- it's up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/c30d1d23753d14417afd703c3264cb57.poster.avif?t=1774504934\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/c30d1d23753d14417afd703c3264cb57.webm?t=1774504934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/c30d1d23753d14417afd703c3264cb57.mp4?t=1774504934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Key Features:</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/5e54af262c16313b3f80a7225a7ec565.poster.avif?t=1774504934\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/5e54af262c16313b3f80a7225a7ec565.webm?t=1774504934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/5e54af262c16313b3f80a7225a7ec565.mp4?t=1774504934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex Simulation:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Prison utilizes many complex systems to allow players to experience prison life. Do the legitimate job of preparing food in the kitchen to work in the workshop to earn money. It is not easy for a prisoner to acquire money, but it's essential to have some disposable cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Expanding Gameplay:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > While the current version of Project Prison already includes many different mechanisms, the gameplay will continually expand to include more advanced mechanics during the early access period.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/c5da92cf339715147ea5be2c97a2f134.poster.avif?t=1774504934\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/c5da92cf339715147ea5be2c97a2f134.webm?t=1774504934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/extras/c5da92cf339715147ea5be2c97a2f134.mp4?t=1774504934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gang Wars:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There are several factions inside the prison. Each faction controls certain areas and illegal trade in the prison. Managing the relationship with them at the neutral level is a tough task, but joining any gang will result in making multiple enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start Your Illegal Trading Empire:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn some extra money by starting your illegal trade inside the prison. Your trade empire's future relies on your ability to adapt to the ever-changing conditions in jail. Being friends with correct people will take you too far in this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulator:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Prison gives you complete control of your character! You can do whatever you like, remember that your loose actions may also affect relations with other inmates. You can also commit your time to exercise or in the library to enhance knowledge in addition to multiple prison block with different areas to interact and improve your character's core skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Have you ever thought about the best place to start your criminal empire without any legal consequences? Now you will finally be able to experience prison life in Project Prison. try to stay alive in a prison which contains’ s the world’s most ruthless inmates.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/10f4ac39726d87524a024659cc66b7b6bae86f1d/header.jpg?t=1774504934", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/7e9dc897776aa1cc30d2d6e5f076196f52c2e2d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774504934", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1333620/7e9dc897776aa1cc30d2d6e5f076196f52c2e2d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774504934", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8 (8.1)/ 10 64Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-61